      "gender": "男",
      "node": "EVENING",
      "extracted_line": 379,
      "text": "还有怎样判断一只股票当前的价格是否合理？",
      "id": "20261013-M049",
      "status": "ADOPTED_IN_USER_SUBMITTED_STORY",
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "market_news_not_independently_verified": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "teacher",
      "source_label": "先生",
      "gender": null,
      "node": "EVENING",
      "extracted_line": 386,
      "text": "各位晚上好！很高兴再次见到大家。\n今天我们从罗马尼亚银行、能源股聊到 ATB，又分析了企业财报和经济预期。\n这些信息看似不同，其实都指向一个问题：怎样判断一家公司的真实价值，以及当前股价\n是否合理？\n今晚，我们就从企业经营、市场预期和股票估值三个方面展开。",
      "id": "20261013-M050",
      "status": "ADOPTED_IN_USER_SUBMITTED_STORY",
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "market_news_not_independently_verified": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "teacher",
      "source_label": "先生",
      "gender": null,
      "node": "EVENING",
      "extracted_line": 400,
      "text": "首先判断一家公司的价值，不能只看股价涨了多少，而要看它是否拥有持续创造利润和现\n金流的能力。\n例如，银行依靠贷款业务和资金管理获取收益；能源企业关注产量、销售价格与经营成本\n医药企业则需要研究产品竞争力、销售增长和研发投入。\n行业不同，赚钱的方式不同，但分析的核心相同：企业的盈利是否可靠，未来能否持续。",
      "id": "20261013-M051",
      "status": "ADOPTED_IN_USER_SUBMITTED_STORY",
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "market_news_not_independently_verified": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "22",
      "source_label": "22男",
      "gender": "男",
      "node": "EVENING",
      "extracted_line": 412,
      "text": "有些公司利润看着不错，但经营现金流却不理想，这种情况应该特别留意吧？",
      "id": "20261013-M052",
      "status": "ADOPTED_IN_USER_SUBMITTED_STORY",
      "warnings": [],
      "fictional_only": true,
      "market_news_not_independently_verified": true,
      "real_trade_not_inferred": true
